<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    1183    602    1652    34</p>
<p> Great Lakes    28016   7430   16773    30</p>
<p> River Points   15892  19217   25502    36</p>
<p> Southwest	14397   8981     565    18</p>
<p> Gulf Points    13321   4716    7009    29</p>
<p> Plains Area    34259  23429    3694    33</p>
<p> Pacific NW     10136   1127     unq    37</p>
<p> Grand Total   117204  65502   55195    31</p>
